BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Catalyst Summer Jam Lunch Crew
DTSTART:20260905T113000
DTEND:20260905T140000
DTSTAMP:20260817T193913Z
UID:6471d9f7df15cf50@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:trail-work
DESCRIPTION:We're looking for a few volunteers to help Pisgah Area SORBA c
 ook lunch at Catalyst Sports End of Summer Jam . We'll be grilling burgers
  and hot dogs while representing PAS\, talking trails\, recruiting volunte
 ers\, and promoting upcoming work days. Catalyst Sports is a volunteer-led
  nonprofit that empowers people with physical disabilities through adaptiv
 e adventure sports\, building confidence\, community\, and healthy\, activ
 e lives. This is a fun way to support the local riding community and help 
 spread the word about the work we're doing on the trails. Perks: • Free 
 Ride Kanuga bike park pass for the day • Hang out with riders\, racers\,
  and volunteers • Help represent Pisgah Area SORBA at a great event Date
 : Saturday\, September 4th Time: 11:30 AM – 2:00 PM Location: Ride Kanug
 a If you're inte\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisg
 ah Area SORBA\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:Ride Kanuga\, Kanuga Lake Road\, Hendersonville\, NC\, USA\, Hend
 ersonville\, NC
URL:https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/
END:VEVENT
