  tools\, guidance\, and instruction. Date: Tuesday\, October 9th Time: 8:3
 0 AM – 2:00 PM Trail Work Location: Cat Gap Trail Meetup Location: F ish
  Hatchery What to Bring: Required: Long pants\, boots that cover your ankl
 es\, safety glasses\, gloves\, hardhat (bike helmets DO NOT count\, but cl
 imbing helmets do)\, snacks/lunch and water. Note: Hardhats\, gloves and s
 afety glasses ca\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisg
 ah Area SORBA\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:1401 Fish Hatchery Rd\, Pisgah Forest\, NC\, USA\, Pisgah Forest\
 , NC
URL:https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/
